---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';

const meta = {
  title: "My Journey as a Unity Game Developer",
  description:
    "From hyper-casual beginnings to multiplayer simulations and international freelancing — my Unity journey across Mobile, PC, and WebGL.",
  date: "2025-08-25",
  category: "About Me",
  image: "", // optional: e.g. "/images/journey/cover.png"
};
---

<Layout title={meta.title} description={meta.description}>
  <!-- ===== HERO ===== -->
  <section class="pt-8">
    <div class="relative w-full overflow-hidden border-y border-white/10 bg-gradient-to-br from-gray-900 via-gray-900/70 to-gray-900">
      <div class="pointer-events-none absolute -inset-1 bg-gradient-to-r from-fuchsia-500/20 via-blue-500/20 to-cyan-400/20 blur-2xl"></div>

      <div class="relative max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 sm:px-12 py-12">
        <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3">
          <span class="px-3 py-1 text-xs font-semibold rounded-full bg-white/5 ring-1 ring-white/10 text-white/80">
            {meta.category}
          </span>
          <span class="px-3 py-1 text-xs rounded-full bg-white/5 ring-1 ring-white/10 text-white/60">
            {meta.date}
          </span>
          <span class="hidden sm:inline-block text-white/30">•</span>
          <span class="text-xs text-white/60 hidden sm:inline-block">~6 min read</span>
        </div>

        <h1 class="mt-4 text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-extrabold text-white tracking-tight">
          {meta.title}
        </h1>

        {meta.image && (
          <div class="mt-6 overflow-hidden rounded-2xl ring-1 ring-white/10">
            <img
              src={meta.image}
              alt={meta.title}
              width="1200"
              height="500"
              class="w-full h-[420px] object-cover rounded-2xl"
              loading="eager"
            />
          </div>
        )}

        <p class="mt-6 max-w-3xl text-gray-300">
          My journey as a Unity Game Developer began with passion and curiosity.
          What started as experimenting with Unity and C# quickly turned into a professional career
          where I’ve worked in studios, collaborated with international clients, and built projects
          across Mobile, PC, and WebGL platforms.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ===== BODY ===== -->
  <section class="px-6 sm:px-12 py-16 bg-gradient-to-b from-gray-950 via-gray-900 to-gray-950">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl grid lg:grid-cols-[1fr_22rem] gap-10">
      <!-- Main story -->
      <article class="max-w-3xl">
        <div class="[&_p]:text-gray-300 [&_p]:leading-7 [&_p]:mt-5
                    [&_h2]:text-2xl [&_h2]:sm:text-3xl [&_h2]:font-extrabold [&_h2]:mt-12 [&_h2]:text-white
                    [&_h3]:text-xl [&_h3]:font-semibold [&_h3]:mt-6 [&_h3]:text-fuchsia-300
                    [&_ul]:list-disc [&_ul]:pl-6 [&_li]:mt-2
                    [&_strong]:text-white">

          <h2>🚀 First Company (March 2021 – June 2022)</h2>
          <p>
            In March 2021, I joined my first company as a Junior Unity Developer. Here, I primarily
            worked on hyper-casual mobile games, learning the essentials of game development and
            publishing.
          </p>
          <h3>Key Highlights</h3>
          <ul>
            <li>Integrated AdMob monetization systems (Banner, Interstitial, Rewarded, App Open Ads)</li>
            <li>Built in-app purchase systems</li>
            <li>Optimized games for smooth mobile performance</li>
            <li>Learned professional studio workflows and team collaboration</li>
          </ul>
          <p>This experience gave me the foundation to grow in the gaming industry.</p>

          <h2>🎮 Second Company (June 2022 – Present)</h2>
          <p>
            In June 2022, I joined my second company, where I still work today as a Unity Game Developer.
            This role helped me move beyond hyper-casuals into simulation and multiplayer games.
          </p>
          <h3>Key Highlights</h3>
          <ul>
            <li>Developed multiplayer systems using <strong>Photon PUN 2</strong></li>
            <li>Created simulation mechanics: AI cars, waypoint systems, delivery/pickup queues, scoring</li>
            <li>Implemented Google Cloud hosting & Unity Addressables for scalable content delivery</li>
            <li>Designed character & weapon purchase/equip systems with in-game currency</li>
            <li>Optimized WebGL builds restricted to PC browsers</li>
          </ul>
          <p>
            Here, I gained expertise in advanced systems, cross-platform builds, and scalable architectures.
          </p>

          <h2>🌍 Freelancing Journey (Part-Time → Fiverr Level 2 Seller)</h2>
          <p>
            Alongside my company work, I began part-time freelancing, taking on small projects with
            international clients. Over time, freelancing grew into a major part of my career. Today,
            I deliver Unity projects worldwide with high client satisfaction.
          </p>
          <h3>Notable Freelance Projects</h3>
          <ul>
            <li>Slot Machine Games — custom probability algorithms for fair, engaging play</li>
            <li>POS Simulation Game — car AI with waypoints, delivery/pickup handling, scoring</li>
            <li>Character & Weapon Unlock Systems — purchase/equip flow with coin-based currency</li>
            <li>WebGL Browser Games — optimized for desktop-only play</li>
            <li>NFT Integrations — experiments with blockchain-based purchases for in-game assets</li>
          </ul>
          <p>
            Freelancing taught me client communication, project management, and delivering high-quality results on time.
          </p>

          <h2>📌 Where I Am Today</h2>
          <ul>
            <li>4+ years hands-on with Unity and C#</li>
            <li>2+ years studio experience (2021 – Present)</li>
            <li>Level 2 freelance status with international clients</li>
            <li>Delivered projects across Mobile, PC, and WebGL</li>
            <li>Expertise in monetization, multiplayer, simulation, and NFT systems</li>
          </ul>

          <h2>🔮 Looking Ahead</h2>
          <p>
            For me, game development is more than a job — it’s about crafting experiences that players love.
            I aim to explore AI-driven gameplay, advanced multiplayer networking, and Web3 technologies.
            My mission is to keep pushing boundaries and create games that blend creativity, technology, and player enjoyment.
          </p>
        </div>
      </article>

      <!-- Sidebar: quick stats / pillars -->
      <aside class="space-y-6">
        <div class="rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-gray-900/70 p-5 shadow-xl">
          <h3 class="text-white font-bold text-lg">Snapshot</h3>
          <div class="mt-4 grid grid-cols-2 gap-3 text-sm">
            <div class="rounded-xl bg-white/5 ring-1 ring-white/10 p-3">
              <div class="text-2xl font-extrabold text-white">4+ yrs</div>
              <div class="text-gray-400">Unity & C#</div>
            </div>
            <div class="rounded-xl bg-white/5 ring-1 ring-white/10 p-3">
              <div class="text-2xl font-extrabold text-white">2+ yrs</div>
              <div class="text-gray-400">Studio exp</div>
            </div>
            <div class="rounded-xl bg-white/5 ring-1 ring-white/10 p-3">
              <div class="text-2xl font-extrabold text-white">3</div>
              <div class="text-gray-400">Platforms: Mobile / PC / WebGL</div>
            </div>
            <div class="rounded-xl bg-white/5 ring-1 ring-white/10 p-3">
              <div class="text-2xl font-extrabold text-white">L2</div>
              <div class="text-gray-400">Freelance level</div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-gray-900/70 p-5 shadow-xl">
          <h3 class="text-white font-bold text-lg">Core Skills</h3>
          <ul class="mt-3 space-y-2 text-sm text-gray-300">
            <li>Photon PUN 2 Multiplayer</li>
            <li>Addressables & Cloud Hosting</li>
            <li>AdMob / IAP Monetization</li>
            <li>AI & Simulation Systems</li>
            <li>WebGL Performance</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-gray-900/70 p-5 shadow-xl">
          <h3 class="text-white font-bold text-lg">Contact</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-gray-300">
            Want to collaborate or discuss a project? Reach out via the Contact page.
          </p>
          <a href="/contact"
             class="mt-4 inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-xl px-4 py-2 font-semibold text-black
                    bg-gradient-to-r from-fuchsia-400 to-cyan-300 hover:from-fuchsia-300 hover:to-cyan-200
                    transition shadow-lg shadow-fuchsia-500/20 no-underline">
            Get in touch
          </a>
        </div>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
